							</button></li></ul></div></template></v-tab-nav><section class="o-tab h-theme--tint2" id="content-overview"><h2 class="h-accessibility">About Ilford Boy</h2><div class="o-panel o-grid h-theme--tint2"><dl class="c-meta o-grid__item"><div class="c-meta__item"><dt class="c-meta__key">Running time</dt><dd class="c-meta__value">2 hours 30 minutes including an interval</dd></div><div class="c-meta__item"><dt class="c-meta__key">Content warning</dt><dd class="c-meta__value"><p><a href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/content-advice">Find out more about the themes in the play.</a></p></dd></div></dl></div><div class="o-panel o-grid h-theme--tint2"><div  id="block-184708" class="o-block o-reviews o-grid__item o-grid__item--full o-block--row-2" data-block='[]'><div class="o-panel o-grid"><ul class="o-review-grid o-grid__item"><li class="o-review-grid__item"><blockquote  class="c-quote c-quote--rating"><div class="c-quote__star-rating" role="img" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars"><svg class="icon" width="70" height="70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 70 70" aria-hidden="true"><g clip-path="url(#a)"><path d="m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z"/></g><defs><clipPath id="a"><path d="M0 0h70v70H0z"/></clipPath></defs></svg><svg class="icon" width="70" height="70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 70 70" aria-hidden="true"><g clip-path="url(#a)"><path d="m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z"/></g><defs><clipPath id="a"><path d="M0 0h70v70H0z"/></clipPath></defs></svg><svg class="icon" width="70" height="70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 70 70" aria-hidden="true"><g clip-path="url(#a)"><path d="m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z"/></g><defs><clipPath id="a"><path d="M0 0h70v70H0z"/></clipPath></defs></svg><svg class="icon" width="70" height="70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 70 70" aria-hidden="true"><g clip-path="url(#a)"><path d="m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z"/></g><defs><clipPath id="a"><path d="M0 0h70v70H0z"/></clipPath></defs></svg><svg class="icon" width="70" height="70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 70 70" aria-hidden="true"><g clip-path="url(#a)"><path d="m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z"/></g><defs><clipPath id="a"><path d="M0 0h70v70H0z"/></clipPath></defs></svg></div><p class="c-quote__text">&quot;The most entertaining British play I’ve seen all year&quot;</p><footer class="c-quote__cite"><cite><p>The Times</p></cite></footer></blockquote></li><li class="o-review-grid__item"><blockquote  class="c-quote c-quote--rating"><div class="c-quote__star-rating" role="img" aria-label="4 out of 5 stars"><svg class="icon" width="70" height="70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 70 70" aria-hidden="true"><g clip-path="url(#a)"><path d="m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z"/></g><defs><clipPath id="a"><path d="M0 0h70v70H0z"/></clipPath></defs></svg><svg class="icon" width="70" height="70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 70 70" aria-hidden="true"><g clip-path="url(#a)"><path d="m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z"/></g><defs><clipPath id="a"><path d="M0 0h70v70H0z"/></clipPath></defs></svg><svg class="icon" width="70" height="70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 70 70" aria-hidden="true"><g clip-path="url(#a)"><path d="m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z"/></g><defs><clipPath id="a"><path d="M0 0h70v70H0z"/></clipPath></defs></svg><svg class="icon" width="70" height="70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 70 70" aria-hidden="true"><g clip-path="url(#a)"><path d="m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z"/></g><defs><clipPath id="a"><path d="M0 0h70v70H0z"/></clipPath></defs></svg></div><p class="c-quote__text">“A fierce and funny portrait of working-class family life”</p><footer class="c-quote__cite"><cite><p>The Telegraph</p></cite></footer></blockquote></li><li class="o-review-grid__item"><blockquote  class="c-quote c-quote--rating"><div class="c-quote__star-rating" role="img" aria-label="4 out of 5 stars"><svg class="icon" width="70" height="70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 70 70" aria-hidden="true"><g clip-path="url(#a)"><path d="m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z"/></g><defs><clipPath id="a"><path d="M0 0h70v70H0z"/></clipPath></defs></svg><svg class="icon" width="70" height="70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 70 70" aria-hidden="true"><g clip-path="url(#a)"><path d="m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z"/></g><defs><clipPath id="a"><path d="M0 0h70v70H0z"/></clipPath></defs></svg><svg class="icon" width="70" height="70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 70 70" aria-hidden="true"><g clip-path="url(#a)"><path d="m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z"/></g><defs><clipPath id="a"><path d="M0 0h70v70H0z"/></clipPath></defs></svg><svg class="icon" width="70" height="70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 70 70" aria-hidden="true"><g clip-path="url(#a)"><path d="m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z"/></g><defs><clipPath id="a"><path d="M0 0h70v70H0z"/></clipPath></defs></svg></div><p class="c-quote__text">“Very, very funny...packed with big feelings”</p><footer class="c-quote__cite"><cite><p>Time Out</p></cite></footer></blockquote></li><li class="o-review-grid__item"><blockquote  class="c-quote c-quote--rating"><div class="c-quote__star-rating" role="img" aria-label="4 out of 5 stars"><svg class="icon" width="70" height="70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 70 70" aria-hidden="true"><g clip-path="url(#a)"><path d="m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z"/></g><defs><clipPath id="a"><path d="M0 0h70v70H0z"/></clipPath></defs></svg><svg class="icon" width="70" height="70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 70 70" aria-hidden="true"><g clip-path="url(#a)"><path d="m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z"/></g><defs><clipPath id="a"><path d="M0 0h70v70H0z"/></clipPath></defs></svg><svg class="icon" width="70" height="70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 70 70" aria-hidden="true"><g clip-path="url(#a)"><path d="m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z"/></g><defs><clipPath id="a"><path d="M0 0h70v70H0z"/></clipPath></defs></svg><svg class="icon" width="70" height="70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 70 70" aria-hidden="true"><g clip-path="url(#a)"><path d="m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z"/></g><defs><clipPath id="a"><path d="M0 0h70v70H0z"/></clipPath></defs></svg></div><p class="c-quote__text">“Witty, sensitive and beautifully performed”</p><footer class="c-quote__cite"><cite><p>Broadway World</p></cite></footer></blockquote></li><li class="o-review-grid__item"><blockquote  class="c-quote c-quote--rating"><div class="c-quote__star-rating" role="img" aria-label="4 out of 5 stars"><svg class="icon" width="70" height="70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 70 70" aria-hidden="true"><g clip-path="url(#a)"><path d="m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z"/></g><defs><clipPath id="a"><path d="M0 0h70v70H0z"/></clipPath></defs></svg><svg class="icon" width="70" height="70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 70 70" aria-hidden="true"><g clip-path="url(#a)"><path d="m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z"/></g><defs><clipPath id="a"><path d="M0 0h70v70H0z"/></clipPath></defs></svg><svg class="icon" width="70" height="70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 70 70" aria-hidden="true"><g clip-path="url(#a)"><path d="m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z"/></g><defs><clipPath id="a"><path d="M0 0h70v70H0z"/></clipPath></defs></svg><svg class="icon" width="70" height="70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 70 70" aria-hidden="true"><g clip-path="url(#a)"><path d="m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z"/></g><defs><clipPath id="a"><path d="M0 0h70v70H0z"/></clipPath></defs></svg></div><p class="c-quote__text">&quot;Witty coming-of-age story...this is a proper riot, innit?&quot;</p><footer class="c-quote__cite"><cite><p>The Standard</p></cite></footer></blockquote></li><li class="o-review-grid__item"><blockquote  class="c-quote"><p class="c-quote__text">“Crackles with life and authenticity”</p><footer class="c-quote__cite"><cite><p>Financial Times</p></cite></footer></blockquote></li></ul></div></div><div  id="block-48881" class="o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-3" data-block='["reviews"]'><blockquote><p><i>The boy lives in Ilford, of course he’s depressed</i></p></blockquote><p>Mixed-race teenager Ted Martin is growing up in 90s East London in a house full of chaos, laughter and tough love.</p><p>One day Patrick arrives, shaking the foundations of Ted's life with his sense of style, humour and love of show tunes. Another way to live explodes into view. One filled with art, possibility and people who see him clearly for the first time.<br /><br />Directed by Donmar Artistic Director <strong>Tim Sheader</strong>, <strong>Danny Lee Wynter</strong>'s <i><strong>Ilford Boy</strong></i> is a funny, moving drama about the ghosts that follow us, the families we choose, and the Streisand that helps us survive.</p></div><div  id="block-48882" class="o-block o-cast-and-creatives o-grid__item o-grid__item--full o-block--row-4" data-block='["text"]'><div class="o-panel o-grid"><ul class="o-profile-grid o-grid__item"><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/lindsey-coulson"><div class="o-image c-profile__image"><img class="o-image__img" src="https://donmar-warehouse.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Productions/Ilford-Boy/Headshots/Lindsey-Coulson.jpeg?w=375&amp;h=375&amp;q=100&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fp-x=0.5376&amp;fp-y=0.375&amp;dm=1790679543&amp;s=e4289a8ede7a0c7cd03dcfd59453b62e" width="375" height="375" alt="" loading="lazy" style="--object-position: 53.76% 37.5%;"></div><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Lindsey Coulson</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Eileen</dd></dl></div></a></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/cary-crankson"><div class="o-image c-profile__image"><img class="o-image__img" src="https://donmar-warehouse.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Productions/Ilford-Boy/Headshots/Cary-Crankson.png?w=375&amp;h=375&amp;q=100&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fp-x=0.4767&amp;fp-y=0.3949&amp;dm=1790679543&amp;s=ae89ad7ab8702501377036fae9e11aaf" width="375" height="375" alt="" loading="lazy" style="--object-position: 47.67% 39.49%;"></div><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Cary Crankson</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Trevor</dd></dl></div></a></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/gershwyn-eustache-jnr"><div class="o-image c-profile__image"><img class="o-image__img" src="https://donmar-warehouse.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Productions/Ilford-Boy/Headshots/Gershwyn-Eustache-Jnr.jpeg?w=375&amp;h=375&amp;q=100&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fp-x=0.5517&amp;fp-y=0.3746&amp;dm=1790679543&amp;s=4ca78d8465077313afa4fa06ebfdee15" width="375" height="375" alt="" loading="lazy" style="--object-position: 55.17% 37.46%;"></div><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Gershwyn Eustache Jnr</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Ken</dd></dl></div></a></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/aaron-gill"><div class="o-image c-profile__image"><img class="o-image__img" src="https://donmar-warehouse.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Productions/Ilford-Boy/Headshots/Gill-Aaron-Headshot-2.jpg?w=375&amp;h=375&amp;q=100&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fp-x=0.5064&amp;fp-y=0.4068&amp;dm=1790679543&amp;s=46ae5b2a4c3e828953ec701ebd57b644" width="375" height="375" alt="" loading="lazy" style="--object-position: 50.64% 40.68%;"></div><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Aaron Gill</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Raj</dd></dl></div