 class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Casting Director</dd></dl></div></a></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/phillippe-cato"><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Phillippe Cato</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Associate Director</dd></dl></div></a></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/jessy-roberts-2"><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Jessy Roberts</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Resident Assistant Director</dd></dl></div></a></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/kate-waters"><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Kate Waters</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Fight Director</dd></dl></div></a></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/hazel-holder"><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Hazel Holder</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Dialect Coach</dd></dl></div></a></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/gurkiran-kaur"><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Gurkiran Kaur</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Specialist Dialect Coach</dd></dl></div></a></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><div class="c-profile"><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Patricia Ojehonmon</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Drama Therapist</dd></dl></div></div></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/barbara-houseman"><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Barbara Houseman</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Voice Director</dd></dl></div></a></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/laura-rushton"><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Laura Rushton</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Costume Supervisor</dd></dl></div></a></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><div class="c-profile"><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Sharon Pearson</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">WHAM Supervisor</dd></dl></div></div></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/jamie-owens"><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Jamie Owens</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Props Supervisor</dd></dl></div></a></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/lilly-mackie"><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Lilly Mackie</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Casting Associate</dd></dl></div></a></li></ul></div></div><div  id="block-50721" class="o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-5" data-block='["castAndCreatives"]'><p class="h-text--small">Illustration by Justin Teodoro. We also wish to acknowledge and thank Talivaldis Stubis, who illustrated the now-iconic poster for the Broadway and theatrical productions of “Funny Girl.” Stubis was a prolific graphic artist who designed and illustrated hundreds of celebrated movie and theatre posters as well as some two dozen popular and beloved children’s books.</p></div><div  id="block-50313" class="o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-1" data-block='[]'><p><i>With special thanks to our Season Supporter, Charles Holloway OBE </i></p></div><v-custom-css styles=""></v-custom-css><div  id="block-92641" class="o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-7" data-block='["reusableContent"]'><p>We would also like to thank our Production Supporters, Mo Fisher &amp; Claude Keith, and Crawford &amp; Mary Harris</p></div><div  id="block-115898" class="o-block o-banner o-grid__item o-grid__item--full o-block--row-8" data-block='["text"]'><a  id="banner-115892" class="c-banner h-theme--red c-banner--image" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/your-visit" data-sc-gtm-category="Banner" data-sc-gtm-label="Your Visit" data-sc-gtm-value=""><picture class="o-image o-image--picture o-image--cover c-banner__image"><source srcset="https://donmar-warehouse.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Theatre-photos/Exterior/721_DW_DONMAR_VARIOUS_2_0010.jpg?w=2458&amp;h=700&amp;q=100&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fp-x=0.5059&amp;fp-y=0.4823&amp;dm=1764072378&amp;s=faa8e81a89752dcbe4a78f70e26ba900" width="2458" height="700" media="(min-width: 1525px)"><source srcset="https://donmar-warehouse.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Theatre-photos/Exterior/721_DW_DONMAR_VARIOUS_2_0010.jpg?w=1525&amp;h=500&amp;q=100&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fp-x=0.5059&amp;fp-y=0.4823&amp;dm=1764072378&amp;s=ea823c382a5f0272ab6b6a211e69dfc7" width="1525" height="500" media="(min-width: 740px)"><source srcset="https://donmar-warehouse.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Theatre-photos/Exterior/721_DW_DONMAR_VARIOUS_2_0010.jpg?w=740&amp;h=400&amp;q=100&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fp-x=0.5059&amp;fp-y=0.4823&amp;dm=1764072378&amp;s=a441730786be615d233a2f6f52d48e94" width="740" height="400" media="(min-width: 400px)"><img class="o-image__img" src="https://donmar-warehouse.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Theatre-photos/Exterior/721_DW_DONMAR_VARIOUS_2_0010.jpg?w=400&amp;h=663&amp;q=100&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fp-x=0.5059&amp;fp-y=0.4823&amp;dm=1764072378&amp;s=a7b4df08c341668c6820b060a03be224" width="400" height="663" alt="" loading="lazy"></picture><div class="c-banner__text"><h3 class="c-banner__title">Your Visit</h3><div  class="c-banner__action o-button o-button--underline o-button--xl">
				Find out more
			</div></div></a></div></div></section><section class="o-tab" id="content-booking-info"><h2 class="h-accessibility">Booking information</h2><div class="o-panel h-theme--tint2"><div class="o-grid"><div  id="block-43304" class="o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-1" data-block='[]'><h3>Ticket Prices</h3></div><div  id="block-43303" class="o-block o-table o-grid__item o-block--row-2 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	" data-block='["text"]'><table><thead><tr><th class="text-left" width="20">Price A</th><th class="text-left" width="20">Price B</th><th class="text-left" width="20">Price C</th><th class="text-left" width="20">35 and under</th><th class="text-left" width="20">Standing</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-label="Price A"
								class="text-left">£70</td><td data-label="Price B"
								class="text-left">£55</td><td data-label="Price C"
								class="text-left">£30</td><td data-label="35 and under"
								class="text-left">£20</td><td data-label="Standing"
								class="text-left">£15</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div  id="block-43324" class="o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-3" data-block='["table"]'><h4>Previews (first four performances)</h4></div><div  id="block-43325" class="o-block o-table o-grid__item o-block--row-4 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	" data-block='["text"]'><table><thead><tr><th class="text-left" width="20">Price A</th><th class="text-left" width="20">Price B</th><th class="text-left" width="20">Price C</th><th class="text-left" width="20">35 and under</th><th class="text-left" width="20">Standing</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-label="Price A"
								class="text-left">£65</td><td data-label="Price B"
								class="text-left">£50</td><td data-label="Price C"
								class="text-left">£25</td><td data-label="35 and under"
								class="text-left">£20</td><td data-label="Standing"
								class="text-left">£15</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div  id="block-177841" class="o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-5" data-block='["table"]'><p>Every booking made online, via telephone or in person will be subject to a £1.75 transaction fee<br />All exchanges and ticket resales are subject to a £2 per ticket admin fee.<br />Members at the Friends level, and above, do not pay transaction or admin fees.</p></div><v-custom-css styles=""></v-custom-css><div  id="block-48884" class="o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-3" data-block='["reusableContent"]'><h3>Access Performances</h3><p>Captioned performance<br />Monday 16 November 7:30pm <br /><br />Audio described performance<br />Saturday 21 November 2:30pm</p><p>Find out more about Access at the Donmar <a href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/your-visit/access">here</a></p></div><div  id="block-48897" class="o-block o-accordion o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-4" data-block='["text"]'><section class="o-accordion"><h3 class="o-accordion__title"></h3><details-utils animate><details class="o-accordion__item"><summary class="o-accordion__subtitle"><span class="o-accordion__subtitle-text">Performance times</span></summary><div class="o-accordion__text o-text"><p>Evenings Mon – Sat 7.30pm<br />Thursday &amp; Saturday matinees 2.30pm (from 17 October)</p></div></details></details-utils><details-utils animate><details class="o-accordion__item"><summary class="o-accordion__subtitle"><span class="o-accordion__subtitle-text">Last minute tickets</span></summary><div class="o-accordion__text o-text"><p>With Donmar Daily there are tickets available for our productions every day online. </p><p>A small allocation of tickets will be released every morning, Monday – Saturday, at 10am for performances seven days later. These are only available online, subject to availability and may not be available for some performances.</p><p>Any returned tickets are made available online to purchase. You can also ask in person at the Box Office. </p></div></details></details-utils><details-utils animate><details class="o-accordion__item"><summary class="o-accordion__subtitle"><span class="o-accordion__subtitle-text">Content advice</span></summary><div class="o-accordion__text o-text"><p><strong>Content warning:</strong> This play contains language and themes prevalent in the 1980s and 1990s, including references to racism, homophobia, classism, misogyny and fatphobia. It also contains depictions of violence and blood, sexual content, domestic violence, smoking, drinking, as well as references to baby loss and suicide. There is also a brief depiction of vomiting.</p></div></details></details-utils></section></div></div></div></section><section class="o-tab" id="content-discover-more"><h2 class="h-accessibility">Discover more</h2><div class="o-panel h-theme--tint2"><div class="o-grid"><section  id="block-183976" class="o-block o-gallery-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--13 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
